extends RichTextLabel

func _ready():
	text = """[color=#00FF00]HUNT THE SNARF - INSTRUCTIONS

A satirical text adventure about escaping the clutches of engagement algorithms.

Your mission: Find and defeat SNARF, the Social Network Algorithm Reinforcing Feedback-loops.

HAZARDS:
- Viral Storms: Will randomly teleport you to another page
- Clickbait Loops: Will trap you forever
- SNARF: The main algorithm you must defeat

COMMANDS:
- move [room]: Move to an adjacent page
- shoot [room]: Fire a Critical Thinking Bolt
- detect: Check for nearby hazards
- help: Show these instructions

TIPS:
- Listen for clicks (Clickbait Loops)
- Feel for engagement (Viral Storms)
- Smell for SNARF code
- Use your Critical Thinking Bolts wisely

Good luck, digital explorer![/color]"""
